{
  "uid": "sphere-collection",
  "title": "Sphere metrics collection",
  "tags": ["sphere", "verified-collection"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 41,
  "editable": false,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {"from": "now-1h", "to": "now"},
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1, "type": "text", "title": "Граница измерений",
      "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 0, "w": 24, "h": 4},
      "options": {"mode": "markdown", "content": "### Реальный сбор Prometheus\nИстория начинается с запуска этого хранилища. Доступность `/metrics` — не проверка Android-видео или сценария. **Покрытие панелей ограничено:** RPS, p95, CPU и размер парка здесь пока не показаны. Эти панели требуют отдельной проверки instrumentation и запросов. Алерт покрывает только потерю сбора метрик."}
    },
    {
      "id": 2, "title": "Доступность backend /metrics", "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 4, "w": 12, "h": 8},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "sphere-prometheus"},
      "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "up{job=\"sphere-backend\"}", "legendFormat": "Сбор backend"}],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"min": 0, "max": 1, "custom": {"spanNulls": false}}},
      "options": {"tooltip": {"mode": "single"}, "legend": {"displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom"}}
    },
    {
      "id": 3, "title": "Время сбора", "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {"x": 12, "y": 4, "w": 12, "h": 8},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "sphere-prometheus"},
      "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "scrape_duration_seconds{job=\"sphere-backend\"}", "legendFormat": "Backend"}],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "s", "min": 0, "custom": {"spanNulls": false}}}
    },
    {
      "id": 4, "title": "Измерений в сборе backend", "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 12, "w": 12, "h": 8},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "sphere-prometheus"},
      "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "scrape_samples_post_metric_relabeling{job=\"sphere-backend\"}", "legendFormat": "После фильтрации"}],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"min": 0, "custom": {"spanNulls": false}}}
    },
    {
      "id": 5, "title": "Ряды хранилища Prometheus", "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {"x": 12, "y": 12, "w": 12, "h": 8},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "sphere-prometheus"},
      "targets": [{"refId": "A", "expr": "prometheus_tsdb_head_series{job=\"prometheus\"}", "legendFormat": "TSDB head"}],
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"min": 0, "custom": {"spanNulls": false}}}
    }
  ]
